# ─── PRODUCTION Environment (Vercel) ───────────────────────────────────────
# Uses Vercel's built-in proxy (defined in vercel.json) to forward /api/* → Azure backend
# This avoids Mixed Content error (HTTPS → HTTP blocked by browsers)
# IMPORTANT: Also set this in Vercel Dashboard → Project Settings → Environment Variables
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
